est candidate.\n\nThus public message: I agree with James's shift to B, note D also lacks reliability evidence, reinforcing B's advantage. Provide evidence: B very conscientious, handles stress well, etc. Mention concerns but argue they are manageable.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate B."}
